  <Docs>
    <summary>
            Options for signing with a post-quantum ML-DSA (AKP) key using
            <see cref="M:Azure.Security.KeyVault.Keys.Cryptography.CryptographyClient.Sign(Azure.Security.KeyVault.Keys.Cryptography.MLDsaSignOptions,System.Threading.CancellationToken)" />.
            </summary>
    <remarks>
            Exactly one of <see cref="P:Azure.Security.KeyVault.Keys.Cryptography.MLDsaSignOptions.Message" /> or <see cref="P:Azure.Security.KeyVault.Keys.Cryptography.MLDsaSignOptions.ExternalMu" /> must be set.
            When <see cref="P:Azure.Security.KeyVault.Keys.Cryptography.MLDsaSignOptions.ExternalMu" /> is specified, <see cref="P:Azure.Security.KeyVault.Keys.Cryptography.MLDsaSignOptions.Context" /> must not be set.
            The algorithm is inferred from the key and is not specified by the caller.
            </remarks>
  </Docs>
